error[B0203]: an optional is never optional again
  --> check/types.bloom:22:14
   |
22 | fn nested(x: Int??) -> Int { 0 }
   |              ^^^^^ `T??` has no meaning `T?` lacks
   |
help: write one `?`: an optional's absence is `none` alone
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#41-the-types

error[B0201]: expected `Float`, found `Int`
 --> check/types.bloom:7:3
  |
7 |   a * b
  |   ^ this is `Int`
  |
help: convert it: `.toFloat()` (Bloom never converts numbers implicitly)
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

error[B0201]: `Post?` may be `none`
  --> check/types.bloom:11:8
   |
11 |   post.title
   |        ^^^^^ `.title` would read nothing when it is `none`
   |
help: write `?.title`, or unwrap it first (`if let`, `??`)
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#45-enums-option-and-result

error[B0206]: `Post` needs `title`
  --> check/types.bloom:15:3
   |
15 |   Post(likes: 1)
   |   ^^^^ missing field(s) without a default
   |
help: pass it: `Post(title: …)`, or give the field a default
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs

error[B0205]: `Post` has no field `like`
  --> check/types.bloom:19:8
   |
19 |   post.like
   |        ^^^^ no such field
   |
help: did you mean `likes`?
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs
